{
  "$defs": {
    "FeatureValue": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个评估时刻的特征值。\n\n- `value`：必填；`None` 表示显式\"不可计算\"（历史不足等），不填补；\n- `inputs_used`：计算该值实际使用的观察条数；为 0 当且仅当 `latest_input_available_time` 为空，\n  且此时 `value` 必须为 `None`（零输入的值只能是填补）；\n- `latest_input_available_time`：所用观察中最大的 `available_time`，不晚于 `evaluation_time`\n  （带 `available_lag` 的完整约束由 `FeatureResult.check_answers` 检查）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "evaluation_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Evaluation Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Value"
        },
        "inputs_used": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Inputs Used",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "latest_input_available_time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Latest Input Available Time"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "evaluation_time",
        "value",
        "inputs_used"
      ],
      "title": "FeatureValue",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次 `compute` 的结果。\n\n- `request_hash`：请求的 `content_hash()`；`provider` / `provider_hash`：Provider 的\n  `name@version` 与其 descriptor 的内容哈希；\n- `values`：非空，`evaluation_time` 严格升序；与请求的 `evaluation_times` 一一对应（由\n  `check_answers` 对照请求检查）；\n- `result_hash`：以上内容的规范 JSON SHA-256，构造时复核（不接受自报的哈希）。\n\n同一请求 + 同一 Provider 版本 → 同一 `result_hash`（确定性由 contract suite 检查）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.2.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "request_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Request Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "provider": {
      "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*@(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Provider",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "provider_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Provider Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "values": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/FeatureValue"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Values",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "result_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Result Hash",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "request_hash",
    "provider",
    "provider_hash",
    "values",
    "result_hash"
  ],
  "title": "FeatureResult",
  "type": "object"
}
